# USB gadget framework for the ZERO 3E's OTG port (USB 2.0 Type-C, also the
# power input). Each line says why it is here (standing rule).
# CONFIG_USB_GADGET: the gadget framework; nothing on the port works without it.
# CONFIG_USB_DWC3_DUAL_ROLE: the DWC3 controller can take either role; the
#   gadget DTS (assets/dts) pins it to peripheral.
# CONFIG_USB_ETH: one network function (CDC ECM through g_ether). RNDIS (dev's)
#   is dropped: a single network function, which Orion chooses (decision 5);
#   the gadget itself is Lemnos's to build from the board file later.
CONFIG_USB_GADGET=y
CONFIG_USB_DWC3_DUAL_ROLE=y
CONFIG_USB_ETH=y
